⚡️🇮🇶 The Islamic Resistance in Iraq, a coalition of Khomeinist Shi'ite militias that fought on Iran's side during the Iran War including Kata'ib Hezbollah, Harakat Hezbollah al-Nujaba, Kata'ib Sayyid al-Shuhada, and Saraya Awliya al-Damm, released a statement refusing to disarm amidst pressure from Iraqi PM Ali al-Zaidi.

Not only are they not going to disarm, but they also declared they're prepared to increase their strength both in quality and in numbers to confront Israel and the United States.

